{"server":"tw","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_05_end","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_05","title":"祝福的歌謠","storyCode":"FC-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"89e53dfb1f94cec843fe9426323e3a0b7230be8e21b10560a855be3d78811b1a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，快跑！這邊也有人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，他們是不是把這片空地都圍起來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"別動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，我、我不動......您的刀，有點太近了......您不會失手吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救、救命啊葦草，我們怎麼辦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......面對這麼多人，很難強行突破。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......啊......棍子被砍斷了？"},{"type":"narration","text":"......他們，很有信心，\n不想暴力抓捕我們，只是想壓制住我們的抵抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這些人的身手也挺不賴的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想不明白，能追到這裡，他們是什麼來歷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，我見過那個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在幾天前，我們遇到那一隊“鬼魂士兵”的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，你們不是特倫特郡的駐軍，不該越權來逮捕這些流民的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這樣不守規矩的話，我們也只好動真格了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不守規矩”這個詞，對你也一樣適用。既然你的破城矛已經卸掉彈藥，你就應該遠離戰場，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，這裡本來就不該是戰場呀？篝火都還沒有熄滅呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的匕首無聲地滑出，尖刃沒有反射出寒光，而是劃出一道煙霧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"匕首僅僅威脅性地指向風笛的喉嚨，而握著它的人從始至終，視線都停留在葦草身上。\n葦草從對方那雙銳利的眼睛裡清晰地讀出，這一切都是衝著自己而來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的長槍上，不該燃燒著火焰嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起徒勞地抵抗，我更希望你能夠明智地選擇放下武器，聽我說明來意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對塔拉人沒有敵意，更不打算傷害平民以示報復。在保護大眾免於禍端的立場上，我與你們應該是站在一起的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是政府文件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，市議會的調查令？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"前維多利亞士兵放下了手中的武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依照特倫特郡市議會的決定，我將對一樁縱火案裡被人遺漏的疑點進行調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我，沒有別的選擇，對嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"——幹什麼？安靜點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......（抽泣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，真難受。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我過去一直想，要死的話，至少該先寫好遺書......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"（要我說，你早該寫了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（剛逃出來的時候是寫了一封，這兩天高興過頭了，撕掉了。我真後悔。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（閉嘴，維恩。我們還沒完蛋呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（人都被綁起來了，能拿來打架的東西也被收走了，我們除了等死還能做什麼？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉......審訊，審訊這個詞多嚇人啊。被審訊的塔拉人，我們聽說過的，有幾個活著回來過？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（葦草那麼心善的人，也不知道他們要從她那裡問出什麼。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我們這些人，互相都是知根知底的，可是葦草她從哪裡來，以前幹了什麼事，我們沒人知道。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼，你敢懷疑她？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不不不，我哪有這個意思呀......我只是......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，塞爾蒙，你總不能不許人怕死吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（從這裡還能看到篝火的光呢，我們有多少天沒見過夜裡的火光了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我真的以為自己逃出來了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"（你還找我商量，借點什麼東西做本錢。我是不是答應做一批燻羽獸肉給你拿去賣？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（別說了。我們要想辦法去看看情況。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，怎麼看？再說，看了又有什麼用？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......我就是不甘心。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我就是不喜歡聽你只能一個勁地歎氣。我蹲在塔拉人街區的路口，或者穿過村子的打穀場的時候......到處都是歎氣聲。我聽膩了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（行了，別廢話，別問我怎麼辦，你明明每次都能自己想出辦法。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我去吸引那幾個看守的注意力，你該做什麼，自己想去。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以放鬆一點，“葦草”，我們只是普通地聊聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一堆溫暖的篝火，還能聽到夜間羽獸的鳴叫，我想這樣的環境比真正的審訊室要愜意許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉默？你也可以選擇沉默，我不會為難你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許之前鄰近地區駐軍有失尊重的行事方式讓你產生了戒心，我替他們向你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是想調查深池的事情嗎？這裡所有人都與深池無關......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用解釋，這些情況我當然已經掌握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個小地方的駐軍確實會因為一場襲擊而對十幾個塔拉人過分計較，隨意加以“深池反叛軍”的罪名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這厚厚的卷宗裡，他們犯的錯誤不值一提。當然，你與其他人的情況稍有不同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我也能想辦法幫助你擺脫這些麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，這一路逃亡，應該很不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果沒有那些嚴苛的律令，他們從一開始，就不需要逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，既然是我們二人之間的閒聊，我希望你說說你自己的事。說說你從更早以前就開始的逃亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不明白你在說什麼。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在問你，\n曾經的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個普通人，沒有任何檔案記錄，醫療體檢、進出移動城市、繳納稅金，什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔拉人常常被驅趕，維多利亞的記錄裡看不到我們，不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，去年秋天小丘郡動亂的時候，你在那裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去年五月半島郡遭受襲擊的時候，你在那裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問的只是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，如果一個人自己都說不出自己本來的名字，說不出自己從哪裡來，是什麼人的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是，就像“影子”一樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳陳，你是不是大概猜到這些人的身份了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。方才與我們交手的並非普通士兵，就地審訊也是很特殊的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上，那個帶頭的人知道很多，才會對我們......對我如此客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對欸。我剛剛還在想，他們可以讓我們站在這裡等著，只是讓人看守，但那些塔拉人就要把雙手綁起來，好不公平......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他是怎麼認出來你的呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒想到情報部門的人會出動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情報部門？情報部門為什麼會找上葦草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她應該身份特殊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她之前執意獨自行動，不想牽連誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我有種不好的感覺......他們真的會好好跟一個塔拉人溝通嗎？他們會不會打她，或者威脅她說違心的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"輕聲些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我還記得你那份關於小丘郡的報告書是怎麼寫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，雖然那個人有市議會的調查令，也說了會和平溝通，對塔拉人沒有敵意什麼的，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不對，我還是應該相信，他是議會決定的執行者，不會亂來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但審訊的壓力，一般人扛不過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你記不記得上學的時候，我們兩人搭檔，是怎麼行動的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你這個手勢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得。那次搶奪高危源石製品的時候，我們用過這套手勢交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草她無論是什麼特殊身份，只要落在他人手裡作為棋子，恐怕都會給現下的局勢帶來不小的風波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她自己也一定會很難過......畢竟她看起來，好像一直想要甩掉自己身上的什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白你的意思了，陳陳。我們幫她回羅德島。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......真是清晰的車轍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你的對手又在邀請你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼揶揄我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，這一次，我恐怕還擔不起“邀請”這個詞，他甚至不會在乎他的客人要跳一支怎樣的舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們露面這件事，本身就足以說明我們的立場了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池去救可憐的拉芙希妮，會暴露她的身份......也會最終證明我站在哪一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他也知道，為了不讓另一條塔拉的德拉克落入他背後那位公爵手中，降低領袖她德拉克這一身份的影響力......我不得不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無妨，我會把他的野心清掃乾淨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......羽獸的叫聲停止了。你知道這意味著什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，先來說說你近期留下的案件記錄吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有對他人造成過嚴重傷害。就連那起發生在駐軍處的火災，也只有一些儲備物資被燒毀，沒有任何人員傷亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般塔拉人對維多利亞駐軍的仇恨犯罪不會如此。相比之下，你的做法很溫和。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至有目擊者指出你嘗試擊退深池士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些，你承認嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只承認，我的確不想傷害他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我可以相信，你是有相當良知的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，關於那些變得安靜的羽獸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你深池的朋友們來救你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能回去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去？哦，你是說，回到作為影子的生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到那種被燃燒的屍體包圍、將死者的灰燼灑滿城市街道的生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於一個有良知的人而言，那樣的生活想必十分痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你恰好有機會，可以做出屬於你自己的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接受我們的庇護，你過去犯下的罪行不會被追究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"我......\n決不！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，但是你們得再試試我破城矛的力量了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"揮動破城矛的風笛沒有看向帳篷的方向，但站在她身後的陳在那一瞬間睜大了眼睛。\n遮蔽審訊者的帳篷悄無聲息地化為灰燼。\n一道火焰在黑夜中迸發，又立刻無影無蹤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
